    "Data is available again. Reconnecting…" : {
      "comment" : "Short note shown when the balance comes back (reserved data returned, the free refresh or an upgrade) and the app retries, by itself, the connect that insufficient balance had blocked.",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
