    "Free data refreshes daily at 00:00 UTC (in %@)." : {
      "comment" : "\"About your data\" sheet: when the free daily data is granted again. {time} is the time left until the next 00:00 UTC as a compact duration (e.g. 5h 12m). Keep 00:00 UTC as is. Shown only to accounts without Pro (Pro does not get the free grant).",
