    "Opens ur.io in your browser. SOCKS and WireGuard need Pro." : {
      "comment" : "Muted note under the Use WireGuard / SOCKS / HTTPS proxy settings row: the row leaves the app for ur.io, and SOCKS and WireGuard proxies are part of the Pro plan (HTTPS is not).",
