    "Peer discovery disabled until connected" : {
      "comment" : "Replaces the network peer count/list while the app is not attached to its remote device (the network extension or service rpc is down — not connected): the peer state lives in the remote device, so the stat is unavailable rather than zero. Shown with a gray dot.",
