    "Provides only to your own network's devices." : {
      "comment" : "One-line explanation of the Network provide mode in the onboarding Contribute bandwidth picker: the private provider for the network's own devices.",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "يوفّر فقط لأجهزة شبكتك الخاصة."
