    "The %@ extension was not found in this browser. Install it, then try again." : {
      "comment" : "Error: the wallet's browser extension is not installed in this browser (on ur.io, or in the apps when a ur.io wallet bridge page returns extension_not_found). The argument is the wallet product name (Talisman on the Bittensor page, Phantom or Solflare on the Solana page).",
