    "The payment form couldn't load. Check your internet connection, then try again." : {
      "comment" : "Checkout error in the desktop apps (the macOS direct download, Windows and Linux) when the ur.io checkout page hands back stripe_unavailable: Stripe's payment form could not be loaded in the checkout page (usually no internet connection, or a network that blocks it). Nothing was charged.",
