    "The request was declined in your wallet. Start again and approve it to continue." : {
      "comment" : "Wallet error in the apps, when a ur.io wallet bridge page returns user_rejected: the user declined the connection or the signature request in the wallet, so nothing was signed. The Bittensor page (Talisman, or a WalletConnect wallet) and the Solana page of the desktop apps (Phantom or Solflare) both return it; on iOS, Phantom and Solflare decline with 4001, which reads the same.",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "تم رفض الطلب في محفظتك. ابدأ من جديد ووافق عليه للمتابعة."
