    "The wallet connection wasn't found in this browser. Start again to reconnect your wallet." : {
      "comment" : "Solana wallet error in the desktop apps (macOS, Windows, Linux) when the ur.io wallet bridge page returns session_not_found: the browser no longer has the wallet connection made in the connect step (another browser or a private window, or its site data was cleared), so nothing was signed. Starting again reconnects the wallet (Phantom or Solflare).",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "لم يتم العثور على اتصال المحفظة في هذا المتصفح. ابدأ من جديد لإعادة ربط محفظتك."
          }
        },
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Připojení peněženky se v tomto prohlížeči nenašlo. Začněte znovu a peněženku znovu připojte."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Die Wallet-Verbindung wurde in diesem Browser nicht gefunden. Starte erneut, um deine Wallet wieder zu verbinden."
