    "The WalletConnect request expired before the wallet answered. Start again." : {
      "comment" : "Bittensor wallet error in the apps, when the ur.io bridge page returns walletconnect_expired: the WalletConnect pairing or the signature request ran out of time before the wallet answered. WalletConnect is a product name.",
