    "These apps can't bypass the VPN right now. Retry, and allow the proxy configuration if macOS asks." : {
      "comment" : "Split rules screen on macOS, Apps section: the split tunnel extension or its proxy configuration could not be installed or started, so the listed apps still use the VPN. The Retry button follows; macOS asks the user to allow URnetwork's proxy configuration the first time. Keep VPN and macOS unchanged.",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "لا يمكن لهذه التطبيقات تجاوز VPN الآن. أعد المحاولة، واسمح بإعداد الوكيل إذا طلب macOS ذلك."
          }
        },
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tyto aplikace teď nemohou obejít VPN. Zkuste to znovu, a pokud se macOS zeptá, povolte konfiguraci proxy."
