    },
    "To keep these apps off the VPN, allow the URnetwork Split Tunnel extension in System Settings." : {
      "comment" : "Split rules screen on macOS, Apps section: the split tunnel system extension waits for the user's one-time approval in System Settings (General > Login Items & Extensions > Network Extensions). Use the name macOS gives System Settings in the language. Keep URnetwork Split Tunnel (the extension's name) and VPN unchanged.",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "لإبقاء هذه التطبيقات خارج VPN، اسمح بملحق URnetwork Split Tunnel في إعدادات النظام."
          }
        },
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Chcete-li tyto aplikace ponechat mimo VPN, povolte v Nastavení systému rozšíření URnetwork Split Tunnel."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Damit diese Apps das VPN umgehen, erlaube die Erweiterung URnetwork Split Tunnel in den Systemeinstellungen."
          }
        },
        "el" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Για να κρατήσετε αυτές τις εφαρμογές εκτός VPN, επιτρέψτε την επέκταση URnetwork Split Tunnel στις Ρυθμίσεις συστήματος."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "To keep these apps off the VPN, allow the URnetwork Split Tunnel extension in System Settings."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Para dejar estas apps fuera de la VPN, permite la extensión URnetwork Split Tunnel en Ajustes del Sistema."
          }
        },
        "es-419" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Para dejar estas apps fuera de la VPN, permite la extensión URnetwork Split Tunnel en Configuración del Sistema."
          }
        },
        "es-MX" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Para dejar estas apps fuera de la VPN, permite la extensión URnetwork Split Tunnel en Configuración del Sistema."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pour garder ces applications hors du VPN, autorisez l’extension URnetwork Split Tunnel dans Réglages Système."
          }
        },
        "he" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "כדי להשאיר את האפליקציות האלה מחוץ ל-VPN, אשר את התוסף URnetwork Split Tunnel בהגדרות המערכת."
          }
        },
        "hi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "इन ऐप्स को VPN से बाहर रखने के लिए, सिस्टम सेटिंग्ज़ में URnetwork Split Tunnel एक्सटेंशन को अनुमति दें।"
          }
        },
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Agar aplikasi ini tidak melalui VPN, izinkan ekstensi URnetwork Split Tunnel di Pengaturan Sistem."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Per tenere queste app fuori dalla VPN, consenti l’estensione URnetwork Split Tunnel in Impostazioni di Sistema."
          }
