    "USDC payouts move to another of your Solana or Polygon wallets, or are held until you connect one." : {
      "comment" : "Body of the remove confirmation for the payout wallet (the title is remove_wallet). Removing the payout wallet makes another of the account's active Solana or Polygon wallets the payout wallet when there is one (the server picks it; payouts_now_go_to names it after the removal), and holds USDC payouts until the user connects a wallet when there is none.",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "تنتقل مدفوعات USDC إلى محفظة Solana أو Polygon أخرى لديك، أو تُحتجز حتى تربط واحدة."
          }
        },
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Výplaty v USDC se přesunou na jinou vaši peněženku Solana nebo Polygon, nebo budou zadrženy, dokud nějakou nepřipojíte."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "USDC-Auszahlungen gehen an eine andere deiner Solana- oder Polygon-Wallets oder werden zurückgehalten, bis du eine verbindest."
          }
        },
        "el" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Οι πληρωμές USDC μεταφέρονται σε άλλο πορτοφόλι σας Solana ή Polygon· αν δεν υπάρχει, παραμένουν σε αναμονή μέχρι να συνδέσετε ένα."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "USDC payouts move to another of your Solana or Polygon wallets, or are held until you connect one."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Los pagos en USDC pasan a otra de tus billeteras de Solana o Polygon, o quedan retenidos hasta que conectes una."
          }
        },
        "es-419" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Los pagos en USDC pasan a otra de tus billeteras de Solana o Polygon, o quedan retenidos hasta que conectes una."
          }
        },
        "es-MX" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Los pagos en USDC pasan a otra de tus carteras de Solana o Polygon, o quedan retenidos hasta que conectes una."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
