    "Your %@ wallet doesn't have the address you entered. Add or connect that account in the wallet, or enter an address it has." : {
      "comment" : "Bittensor wallet error, on the ur.io wallet card and sign-in, and in the apps when the ur.io bridge page returns address_not_in_wallet: the chosen wallet does not offer the account of the address the user typed (Talisman does not hold it or has not connected it to the site; a WalletConnect wallet connected another account), so nothing was signed. The argument is the wallet product name (Talisman or WalletConnect).",
