    "Your account isn't ready for purchases. Please restart the app and try again." : {
      "comment" : "Shown when a purchase is refused before contacting the store because the account is not ready: on apple the networkId is missing or unparseable (Shared/ViewModels/AppStoreSubscriptionManager.swift), on android the active network space has no api yet (the Stripe sheet and pay page purchasers). The purchase could never be credited to anyone. This used to be a silent no-op.",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "حسابك غير جاهز لعمليات الشراء بعد. يرجى إعادة تشغيل التطبيق والمحاولة مرة أخرى."
          }
