    "Your subscription was purchased under a different account. Log in to that account to use it." : {
      "comment" : "The store purchase belongs to a different network than the one logged in — crediting must not go to the wrong account, so tell the user which way out exists. Apple: restore-purchases outcome (Shared/ViewModels/AppStoreSubscriptionManager.swift). Android: terminal `wrong_network` answer from the Play purchase report (google/PlanViewModel.kt); the purchase is still acknowledged so Play does not auto-refund it.",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "تم شراء اشتراكك باستخدام حساب مختلف. سجّل الدخول إلى ذلك الحساب لاستخدامه."
          }
        },
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Vaše předplatné bylo zakoupeno pod jiným účtem. Chcete-li ho používat, přihlaste se k tomuto účtu."
